The `.pbf` files in this directory are pre-rendered signed-distance-field glyph
atlases generated from Open Sans Semibold. They are vendored by
`scripts/vendor-glyphs.mjs` so that map labels do not depend on
`demotiles.maplibre.org` — MapLibre's demo tile server, which is explicitly not
intended for production traffic — at runtime.

Regenerate with:

    node scripts/vendor-glyphs.mjs
